    "description": {
      "value": "<p><strong>Working.</strong> <em>Stop being entirely present.</em></p>\n<p>Phase the wraith partially out of the current frame. Until the start of its next turn, attackers reroll the highest die on attacks against it; each missed attack costs the attacker 1d6 qliphothic damage to Stress as the slip bleeds back into them.</p>\n<p><strong>Cost.</strong> 1 Clarity, +2 Noise · action · self / self.</p>\n<p><em>The air around it remembers things that didn't happen.</em></p>"
